{"overview":"گوجو واکانا یک پسر دبیرستانی است که عاشق ساخت و طراحی عروسک های هیناست؛ ولی درگذشته بخاطر علایقش مورد تمسخر قرار گرفته و تبدیل به یک منزوی اجتماعی شده، تا اینکه همکلاسی پر شور و اشتیاقش یعنی کیتاگاوا مارین که همیشه دوست داشته کاسپلی کردن را امتحان کند، از گوجو می‌خواهد برایش لباس کاسپلی درست کند و این آغازی بر روابط پیچیده آنهاست.","tagline":"","overview_en":"High schooler Wakana Gojo wants to become a kashirashi—a master craftsman who makes traditional Japanese Hina dolls. Though he's gung-ho about the craft, he knows nothing about the latest trends, and has a hard time fitting in with his class. The popular kids—especially one girl, Marin Kitagawa—seem like they live in a completely different world. That all changes one day, when she shares an unexpected secret with him, and their completely different worlds collide.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":24,"y":2022,"poster":"/rDvGkWwMfgbSK1I6P2h4cTtYoFs.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"直田姫奈","role":"Marin Kitagawa (voice)","photo":"/yZPGi67sEBDjrYXiZdLwp8KCwwg.jpg","en":"Hina Suguta"},{"name":"شویا ایشیگه","role":"Wakana Gojo (voice)","photo":"/ohW9TNSoiL9n5SgLBbAj85wJXAA.jpg","en":"Shoya Ishige"}],"trailer":"8oveGY6h6T8","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/123249/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/123249/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/r